## Neue Datapack Struktur:

# Datapack Strucktur:
# (+) = Neu
# (>) = Bearbeiten
# (-) = Entfernen
# (*) = Alt/Vorhanden
* Main
    * data
        * <Namespace>
            * function
				* <folder1>
					* <underfolder>
		                > edit.mcfunction
		                + new.mcfunction
		                - delete.mcfunction



